@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
title Baseline / Skill Assessment / pathway / recalculation - current local source 2026-11-18
component "Scoped configuration
L&D: org + Role/member Level baseline
Expert: org + Skill/knowledge from assigned Roles
Draft/version/activation; quota and retake parameters" as Config
component "Selected Role baseline
Only explicit MODULE_ONLY targets minus official evidence
Frozen TARGET paper, timer, answers and group results
Pass is diagnostic; no speculative prerequisite closure" as Baseline
component "Confirm request + generation
Expected selection/revision/planning hash
Bind Role + Level; freeze planning input
All valid options/certificate or explicit missing provision" as Request
component "Assigned Expert review
Reduce unstarted options / check / reject / approve
First approval pins UTC calendar-month deadline
Missing-provision-only bypass; original approval basis" as Review
component "Approved module / certificate learning
Exact version/content, accepted step and real progress
Content completion is not official achievement
Certificate decision is a separate evidence source" as Learning
component "Skill Assessment
MAIN + complete configured prerequisite closure
Exact mandatory quota + ordinary questions
Module-context allowance/wait; full new retake paper" as Exam
component "Durable outcome job
Recalculate actual failed nonofficial prerequisites first
MAIN_FAILED / VETO / WAITING_SUPPLEMENT / READY
Keep prior official evidence + NEED_REVIEW" as Outcome
component "Genuine evidence + second recalculation
Insert exact official evidence once when READY
Recalculate again in the same learner transaction
Preserve scores, dependencies, progress and receipts" as Evidence
component "Provision/evidence refresh + immutable revisions
Preserve completed steps, exclusions and valid approval
Missing provision -> Expert action; invalid basis -> review
Carried bypass roots stay parallel and non-gating" as Refresh
Config --> Baseline : active BASELINE policy
Baseline --> Request : diagnostic readiness + explicit confirm
Request --> Review : proposal; no learning grant
Review --> Learning : exact accepted revision
Learning --> Exam : qualifying exact module completion
Exam --> Outcome : finalized score + persisted job
Outcome --> Evidence : READY with real required conditions
Evidence --> Refresh : source-event history / current plan
Refresh --> Learning : accepted live content/prerequisite guards
Refresh --> Review : invalid approval basis / missing provision
note bottom of Evidence
  Learner/request locks, command/source receipts, revision CAS and retryable jobs.
  Six V64 timing fields: first approval and real completion facts, no clock reset.
  Transactional in-app decisions/added-provision notifications are not SMTP proof.
  Neo4j is catalog only; PostgreSQL owns all private state/history. No distributed transaction.
end note
@enduml
